    "directions": [
      "First you’ll need to wash your fresh broccoli and cauliflower and cut into florets then add to a mixing bowl.",
      "Then season with 1tsp salt, pepper, browning, pimento, paprika, half of bell peppers, fresh thyme then mix together and marinate for a few hours.",
      "In your frying pan add vegetable oil on a high heat, then add your onions and garlic and saute for a few minutes.",
      "Add 1 tsp browning, thyme, black pepper, 1 sliced scotch bonnet and mix until you form a brown paste.",
      "Add your marinated broccoli & cauliflower and mix together.",
      "Add 1 cup of water, and steam vegetable until soft. Give it one last mix together and add the remaining bell peppers.",
      "Then serve as a side dish on eat on its own!"
    ],
